## Commercial Licensing

For commercial use requiring different licensing terms, custom support, or
enterprise features, please contact the development team.

### Subscription Tiers

This software includes optional subscription-based features managed through
Stripe. See SUBSCRIPTION_GUIDE.md for details on:

- Free tier: Basic features
- Professional tier: Advanced features and priority support
- Enterprise tier: Full features, SLA guarantees, and dedicated support

The subscription system is integrated via billing.py and follows industry-standard
practices for payment processing and license management.

### Third-Party Licenses

This software includes dependencies with their own licenses. See requirements.txt
for the full list of dependencies. Notable inclusions:

- cryptography (Apache 2.0 / BSD)
- stripe (MIT)
- SQLite (Public Domain)
- Other Python packages as listed in requirements.txt

All third-party software remains under their respective licenses.
